1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:01,970
(Amy:)Okay, your turn.

2
00:00:02,041 --> 00:00:04,241
(Amy:)Hmm. Seal,

3
00:00:04,310 --> 00:00:06,380
(Amy:)hagfish...

4
00:00:06,446 --> 00:00:09,546
(Amy:)SpongeBob SquarePants.

5
00:00:09,616 --> 00:00:12,386
(Sheldon:)Well, I'd befriend SpongeBob
but he's not real,

6
00:00:12,452 --> 00:00:13,782
(Sheldon:)so I can't do that, can I?

7
00:00:13,853 --> 00:00:16,423
(Amy:)But you can pal around
with a hagfish?

8
00:00:16,489 --> 00:00:19,429
(Sheldon:)Hey, let's not pull
at that thread.

9
00:00:19,492 --> 00:00:21,322
(Howard:)Okay. I'll
fight SpongeBob,

10
00:00:21,394 --> 00:00:25,134
(Sheldon:)because he's so friendly we'll
just end up tickling each other.

11
00:00:25,198 --> 00:00:26,928
(Sheldon:)Um, I'll befriend the seal,

12
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:28,730
(Sheldon:)because he's trainable,
which is the problem

13
00:00:28,801 --> 00:00:30,401
(Sheldon:)I'm having with my
current friends.

14
00:00:30,470 --> 00:00:34,410
(Sheldon:)Which means I'll have
to eat the hagfish.

15
00:00:34,474 --> 00:00:37,074
(Amy:)Isn't that gross?
I mean, a hagfish can produce

16
00:00:37,143 --> 00:00:39,643
(Amy:)enough mucus to fill a bucket
in a minute.

17
00:00:39,712 --> 00:00:43,352
(Sheldon:)I know. It makes its own gravy...
it'll slide right down.

18
00:00:47,954 --> 00:00:51,954
(Amy:)I miss this.

19
00:00:52,025 --> 00:00:55,665
(Sheldon:)How can you miss a game you've
never played before, silly?

20
00:00:58,051 --> 00:01:03,021
(Amy:)I guess sometimes I'm silly.

